Usage:
  ./zagkit init [path]
  ./zagkit build [--path <path>] [--output <binary>]
  ./zagkit run [--project <path>] [--binary <binary>] [--output <png>] [--headless-only] [--show-ascii] [--open]
  ./zagkit test

Current status: this command only exposes the headless reference and contract
test surface. It does not launch a native desktop, Wayland, macOS,
Windows, iOS, or Android shell yet.
